From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] feat(dev): add VKD3D_DISPATCH_BARRIER experiment
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dev only, experiment that did not ship (OVERVIEW.md section 5).

Problem: Requiem black screen; hypothesis that the game omits a barrier
between compute writes and later graphics reads, which Windows drivers
tolerate.

Root cause: hypothesis not confirmed.

Fix: a full memory barrier after every dispatch.

Verified by: did not help the black screen (N§29); the actual cause was a
D3D11/DXGI pairing in the bottle setup.

Off switch: off by default; VKD3D_DISPATCH_BARRIER=1 enables.
---
 libs/vkd3d/command.c | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/command.c b/libs/vkd3d/command.c
index ac28d31..c4832b5 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/command.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/command.c
@@ -10054,6 +10054,32 @@ static void STDMETHODCALLTYPE d3d12_command_list_Dispatch(d3d12_command_list_ifa
     VKD3D_BREADCRUMB_AUX32(z);
     VKD3D_BREADCRUMB_COMMAND(DISPATCH);
 
+    /* Experiment: a full memory barrier after every dispatch, so compute writes are visible to later graphics work
+     * even when the application omits the barrier (Windows drivers tolerate that). Off by default; VKD3D_DISPATCH_BARRIER=1 enables.
+     * Did not fix Requiem's black screen. */
+    {
+        static int enabled = -1;
+        if (enabled < 0)
+        {
+            char env[16];
+            enabled = vkd3d_get_env_var("VKD3D_DISPATCH_BARRIER", env, sizeof(env)) && env[0] == '1';
+            if (enabled)
+                vkd3d_failure_log("info", "experiment: full memory barrier after every dispatch is on");
+        }
+        if (enabled)
+        {
+            VkMemoryBarrier2 mb = { VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_MEMORY_BARRIER_2 };
+            VkDependencyInfo dep = { VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_DEPENDENCY_INFO };
+            mb.srcStageMask = VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_COMPUTE_SHADER_BIT;
+            mb.srcAccessMask = VK_ACCESS_2_SHADER_WRITE_BIT;
+            mb.dstStageMask = VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_ALL_COMMANDS_BIT;
+            mb.dstAccessMask = VK_ACCESS_2_MEMORY_READ_BIT | VK_ACCESS_2_MEMORY_WRITE_BIT;
+            dep.memoryBarrierCount = 1;
+            dep.pMemoryBarriers = &mb;
+            VK_CALL(vkCmdPipelineBarrier2(list->cmd.vk_command_buffer, &dep));
+        }
+    }
+
     d3d12_command_list_check_compute_barrier(list);
 }
 
